# type(scope): summary            <- 72 chars max, imperative, no period
#
# types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope: site template modules cli plugin governance ci deps (optional)
# breaking change: add ! after the scope, e.g. feat(cli)!: drop --legacy
#
# Body: why the change was needed, wrapped at 72 columns.
#
# Footer:
# Closes #123
# BREAKING CHANGE: what callers must change
#
# Use it once per clone:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
